OL,3,GNEWSAGreen travel plan to link city and
OL,4,Acommunities
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "bold and exciting" plan setting out
OL,7,Fa long-term vision for walking,
OL,8,Fwheeling and cycling routes in and out
OL,9,Fof a city has been launched.
OL,11,FOxfordshire County Council, Oxford City
OL,12,FCouncil and the University of Oxford
OL,13,Fsaid The Oxford Greenways would help
OL,14,Fconnect Oxford with nearby towns,
OL,15,Fvillages, employment centres and green
OL,16,Fspaces.
OL,18,FThe 18 proposed routes would be
OL,19,Fextending around Oxford and connecting
OL,20,Fcommunities within about eight miles
OL,21,F(13km) of the city, including
OL,22,FWoodstock, Kidlington and Abingdon.
